# HolisticDrive webapp — environment configuration
# Copy this file to ".env" and edit values, then `npm start` will pick them up.

# ===========================================================================
# Auth (optional)
# ===========================================================================
# By default the server uses your Claude Code subscription credentials
# (signed in via `claude` CLI). If you'd rather use a pay-per-token API key,
# uncomment the line below and paste your key from console.anthropic.com.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ===========================================================================
# Server (optional)
# ===========================================================================
# Port the local server listens on. Default 8847.
# PORT=8847

# Hostname to bind to. Default 127.0.0.1 (loopback only — local access only).
# Do NOT change this to 0.0.0.0 unless you understand the implications
# (your server becomes reachable from your local network).
# HOST=127.0.0.1
